id=vintf_vndk_fix
name=VINTF vendor-ndk fix / 消除开机“系统内部出现问题”弹窗
version=1.1
versionCode=2
author=TB321FU-Flash
description=Bind-mounts a framework VINTF manifest that declares VNDK 30-34 over /system/etc/vintf/manifest.xml in post-fs-data, so Build.isBuildConsistent() passes against the ZUI 17.5 vendor matrix (vendor-ndk 34). Needs no metamodule. Remove before flashing a different GSI build. / 在 post-fs-data 阶段把声明了 VNDK 30-34 的框架 VINTF 清单 bind mount 到 /system/etc/vintf/manifest.xml，使 ZUI 17.5 vendor 的兼容性校验通过；不依赖元模块。换 GSI 版本前先卸载。
